        {
            "title": "半日收市︱跌後V彈 恒指半日跌幅收窄至143點 兩萬二失復得 滙控倒升",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">環球股市大幅波動，港股早市先挫後於低位V彈，在兩萬二關口失而復得，中午收市時跌幅大幅收窄，滙控(00005)暫別四連跌，早市倒升收場。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250305_FI_source-web_HSBC-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250305_FI_source-web_HSBC-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：滙控官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數低開242點後於早市全程報跌，中段一度失守22,000點，低見21,998點，跌幅擴大至412點，其後先在低位喘穩，於上午11時左右跌幅開始顯著收窄，最高曾報22,304點，僅跌106點，後段在22,200點之上整固。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250305_FI_source-web_HSBC-3.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250305_FI_source-web_HSBC-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：滙控官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20231207_FI_source-web_09988.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20231207_FI_source-web_09988.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：網易官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240410_FI_source-web_09999.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：網易官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240410_FI_source-web_09999.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：網易官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"老鋪黃金官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/06181-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"老鋪黃金官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/06181-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">老鋪黃金官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls-text bpcategory-special-color\">更多相片</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__buttons\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250305_FI_source-web_HSBC-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：滙控官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20231207_FI_source-web_09988.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：網易官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240410_FI_source-web_09999.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：網易官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"老鋪黃金官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/06181-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">老鋪黃金官網</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指中午收報22,267點，跌143點或0.64%。恒生科技指數毫無懸念跑輸大市，半日跌38點或1.09%，報3,472點；國企指數跌59點或0.79%，報7,494點。主板半日成交1,283.42億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指半日跌154點，報22,276點，高水9點。科指期貨跌35點，報3,476點，高水3點。國指期貨跌62點，報7,500點，高水5點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20231207_FI_source-web_09988.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20231207_FI_source-web_09988.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：阿里巴巴官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">重磅科網股仍跌多於升，「ATMXJ」跌幅全部超過1%，但較今早低位已均跌少一截。阿里巴巴(09988)曾失守80元關，低見79.5元，當時跌幅達4.62%；中午收報82.15元，跌幅收窄至1.44%。騰訊(00700)再創52周新低，中午收報337.8元，跌1.8%，但較低位333元跌少逾四成。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">在「ATMXJ」其餘3位成員中，小米(01810)表現較遜，跌1.74%，報27.16元；美團(03690)也跌1.35%，報65.6元，創3個月低位；京東(09618)跌1.17%，報96.8元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">餘下重磅科網藍籌股當中，百度(09888)又創歷史新低，中午收報62.75元，跌2.03%；快手(01024)則跌2.11%，報19.99元。上日急挫的網易(09999)，今早反彈4.22%，報160.5元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：網易官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240410_FI_source-web_09999.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：網易官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20240410_FI_source-web_09999.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：網易官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">除了網易逆市反彈外，個別熱門科股亦報升。聯想(00992)升4.1%，報17.02元；中際旭創(03308)漲5.92%，報519元；建滔積層板(01888)升1.13%，報23.22元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">兩隻AI模型股個別發展，智譜(02513)反覆升0.9%，報337元；MiniMax(00100)曾失守百元關，半日跌0.88%，報101.5元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">兩大藍籌國際金融股互有升跌，滙控於早市後段開始倒升，中午收報129.7元，升0.39%；友邦(01299)則全程報跌，報73.35元，跌1.15%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">金價回升，金屬資源股與金飾零售股借勢反彈。老鋪黃金(06181)成表現最佳藍籌，升4.8%，報266.2元；周大福(01929)也升3.02%，報11.25元；紫金礦業(02899)升3.64%，報23.9元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"老鋪黃金官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/06181-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"老鋪黃金官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/06181-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">老鋪黃金官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">生科藥股也普遍向好，藥明生物(02269)升3.17%，報42.26元；藥明康德(02359)升3.03%，報187元。翰森製藥(03692)也升2.47%，報31.5元；百濟神州(06160)升1.39%，報234元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內地車股則是重災區，零跑汽車(09863)績後急挫14.63%，報26.02元，創52周新低。理想汽車(02015)在藍籌中表現排包尾，半日跌5.64%，報41.16元，創上市以來新低；同樣破底的尚有蔚來(09866)，中午收報20.06元，跌4.48%；小鵬集團(09868)跌7.65%，報33.82元，也創52周新低。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17243311-%e5%8d%8a%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%b8%b1%e8%b7%8c%e5%be%8cv%e5%bd%88-%e6%81%92%e6%8c%87%e5%8d%8a%e6%97%a5%e8%b7%8c%e5%b9%85%e6%94%b6%e7%aa%84%e8%87%b3143%e9%bb%9e-%e5%85%a9%e8%90%ac%e4%ba%8c",
